      {
        "text": "I had the pleasure of working alongside Matan at Amdocs on the Digital UI program for Altice, where we were both frontend developers on the same customer-facing platform.\n\nMatan is a strong full-stack developer with deep frontend skills. He's highly proficient in React, JavaScript and modern UI tooling. What stands out most is his curiosity and drive to keep improving. He's always among the first to explore new technologies, whether that's upgrading our component tooling or adopting AI-assisted development tools early and showing the team how much time they can save. He did all this while pursuing his degree, which says a lot about his discipline and work ethic.\n\nHe contributed to successful deliveries, including an Okta integration demo that was well received. He's also a great teammate. He's generous with his knowledge, always ready to discuss an architecture idea or help debug a tricky configuration, and he's honest and practical when giving advice.\n\nAny team would be lucky to have Matan. I highly recommend him.",
